# NexNOC credentials — copy to /etc/nexnoc/nexnoc.env (mode 0640).
# systemd EnvironmentFile= loads this for nexnoc-poller / nexnoc-web.
# Names must match the *_env fields in config.json.
# Never put values in config.json. Placeholders only — not production secrets.

